        "id": "tool:work-out-history-values",
        "label": "Work out values from a field's history",
        "status": "active",
        "job": "Work out, from the values a field of a row has held over time, the value it held at a moment, the value before the current one, since when it holds it, how long it spent holding a value and whether it ever held one",
        "description": "Send kept (the row, with _history: { <field id>: { cut, steps: [{ v, at, by?, via? }] } }, the steps a history-keeping field kept), fields ([{ id, history: { field, op, value?, at?, days_ago?, unit? } }], op one of value_at, previous_value, value_set_at, time_spent_in, has_been_in; unit seconds, minutes, hours or days) and now_ms. Answers values { <field id>: value }. An answer that needs history that was not kept (steps let go, or a first value whose start is not known) is null, never a guess. A field that is not finished (no op, no value for time_spent_in or has_been_in, no at or days_ago for value_at, an unknown unit) is refused with a sentence.",
